U-Boot loader and related files for the Pine64 SOQuartz (RK3566) on the
Model A carrier board.

Built from the mainline U-Boot soquartz-model-a-rk3566_defconfig, so U-Boot
uses the rk3566-soquartz-model-a device tree for hardware bring-up (DRAM, MMC,
regulators, GMAC) instead of the quartz64-a tree, which resets at GMAC/Net init
on this board.

To install this bootloader on an sdcard just do:

dd if=/usr/local/share/u-boot/u-boot-soquartz-model-a/idbloader.img of=/path/to/sdcarddevice seek=64 bs=512 conv=sync
dd if=/usr/local/share/u-boot/u-boot-soquartz-model-a/u-boot.itb of=/path/to/sdcarddevice seek=16384 bs=512 conv=sync
